        "Ship sailed out into the blue and sunny morn, the",
        "Sweetest sight ever seen",
        "V2:",
        "(And the) night followed day and the storytellers say that the",
        "Score brave souls inside, for",
        "Many a lonely day sailed across the milky seas, ne'er looked",
        "Back, never feared, never cried",
        "C:",
        "(Don't you) hear my call though you're many years away, don't you",
        "Hear me calling you, write your",
        "Letters in the sand for the day I take your hand in the",
        "Land that our grandchildren knew",
        "BR:",
        "(Instrumental)",
        "V1:",
        "(In the) year of '39 came a ship in from the blue the ",
        "Volunteers came home that day, and they ",
        "Bring good news of a world so newly born, though their ",
        "Hearts so heavily weigh",
        "V2:",
