        "Now, oh, what if they came down crashing",
        "In a way I used to play for all of the loneliness that nobody",
        "notices",
        "Now I'm begging slow I'm coming here",
        "PC:",
        "Only waiting",
        "I wanted to stay, I wanted to play, I wanted to love you",
        "I'm only this far and only tomorrow leads the way",
        "I'm coming waltzing back and moving into your head",
        "C2:",
