        "T:",
        "G#m7Bdim/C# F#maj7"
      ],
      "lyrics": [
        "I:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V1:",
        "In a little while from now if I'm not feeling any less sour, I",
        "Promise myself to treat myself and visit a nearby tower",
        "And climbing to the top will throw myself off, in an",
        "Effort to make clear to whomever what it's like when you're shattered",
        "V2:",
        "(Left) standing in the lurch at a church where people saying",
        "My God, that's tough, she stood him up no point in us remaining",
        "C:",
        "We may as well go home as I did on my own",
        "Alone again, naturally",
        "V1:",
        "To think that only yesterday, I was cheerful, bright and gay",
        "Looking forward to, well, who wouldn't do the role I was about to play",
        "But as if to knock me down, reality came around, and",
        "Without so much as a mere touch cut me into little pieces",
        "V2:",
        "Leaving me to doubt talk about God in His mercy",
        "Who if He really does exist why did He desert me?",
        "C:",
        "And in my hour of need I truly am indeed",
        "Alone again, naturally",
        "BR:",
        "It seems to me that there are more hearts broken in the world that can't be Mended, left unattended, what do we",
        "Do? What do we do?",
        "I2:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "I3:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "Alone again, naturally",
        "V1:",
        "Now looking back over the years and whatever else that appears, I",
        "Remember I cried when my father died never wishing to hide the tears",
        "And at sixty-five years old, my mother, God rest her soul",
        "Couldn't understand why the only man she had ever loved had been taken",
        "V2:",
        "Leaving her to start with a heart so badly broken",
        "Despite encouragement from me no words were ever spoken",
        "C:",
        "And when she passed away, I cried and cried all day",
        "Alone again, naturally",
        "T:",
        "Alone again, naturally"
      ]
    }
