        "This city desert makes you feel so cold it's got so many people, but it’s got no soul and it's",
        "Taken you so long to find out you were wrong when you thought it held everything",
        "C:",
        "You used to think that it was so easy, you used to say that it was so easy",
        "But you’re trying, you’re trying now",
        "Another year and then you’d be happy, just one more year and then you’d be happy",
        "But you’re crying, you’re crying now",
        "I2:",
        "(instrumental sax)",
        "V:",
        "Way down the street there’s a light in his place, he opens the door, he’s got that look on his face and he",
        "Asks you where you’ve been, you tell him who you’ve seen and you talk about anything",
        "He’s got this dream about buying some land, he's gonna give up the booze and the one-night stands and",
        "Then he’ll settle down in some quiet little town and forget about everything",
        "C:",
