        "C:",
        "I don't want to work, I want to bang on the drum all day",
        "I don't want to play, I just want to bang on the drum all day",
        "V:",
        "Ever since I was a tiny boy, I don't want no candy, I don't need no toy",
        "I took a stick and an old coffee can, I bang on that thing 'til I got blisters on my hand because",
        "C:",
        "I don't want to work, I want to bang on the drum all day (yes I do)",
        "I don't want to play, I just want to bang on the drum all day (that's right)",
        "V:",
        "When I get older they think I'm a fool, the teacher told me I should stay after school",
        "She caught me pounding on the desk with my hands, but my licks was so hot I made the teacher want to dance and that's why",
        "C:",
        "I don't want to work, I want to bang on the drum all day (hey, why not?)",
        "I don't want to play, I just want to bang on the drum all day (I just wanna bang now)",
