      "lyrics": [
        "I1:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V1:",
        "I am just a poor boy though my story's seldom told, I have",
        "Squandered my resistance for a pocket full of mumbles, such are",
        "Promises...all lies and jests, still a",
        "Man hears what he wants to hear and disregards the rest",
        "I2:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V2:",
        "(When I) left my home and my family I was no more than a boy, in the",
        "Company of strangers, in the quiet of the railway station",
        "Running scared...laying low, seeking",
        "Out the poorer quarters where the ragged people go, looking",
        "For the places only they would know",
        "C:",
        "(Lie la) lie, lie la la la lie lie, lie la",
        "Lie, lie la la la la lie la la la la lie",
        "I1:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V3:",
        "(Asking) only workman's wages I come looking for a job but I get no",
        "Offers, just a come-on from the whores on Seventh",
        "Avenue...I do declare there were",
        "Times when I was so lonesome, I took some comfort there",
        "I3:",
        "(instrumental) La la la la la la",
        "I4:",
        "(instrumental piccolo trumpet)",
        "C:",
        "(Lie la) lie, lie la la la lie lie, lie la",
        "Lie, lie la la la la lie la la la la lie",
        "I1:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V4:",
        "(Then I'm) laying out my winter clothes and wishing I was gone, going",
        "Home, where the New York City winters aren't",
        "Bleeding me, leading me",
        "...Going home",
        "I2:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V2:",
        "(In the) clearing stands a boxer and a fighter by his trade, and he",
        "Carries the reminders of every glove that laid him down or",
        "Cut him till he cried out in his anger and his shame, \"I am",
        "Leaving, I am leaving\" but the fighter still remains",
        "Mmm",
        "C2:",
        "[(Lie la) lie, lie la la la lie lie, lie la",
        "Lie, lie la la la la lie la la la la lie] x8",
        "O:",
        "(instrumental)"
      ]
    }
  },
