      "lyrics": [
        "I:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "-",
        "-",
        "(Doo do do do, doo do do do)",
        "V:",
        "(There's a) port on a western bay and it ",
        "Serves a hundred ships a day, lonely ",
        "Sailors pass the time away, and ",
        "Talk about their homes",
        "V:",
        "(And there's a) girl in this harbor town and she ",
        "Works laying whiskey down, they say ",
        "\"Brandy, fetch another round\" she ",
        "Serves them whiskey and wine",
        "C:",
        "(The sailors say) \"Brandy, you're a fine girl (you're a fine girl) what a",
        "Good wife you would be (such a fine girl) yeah your ",
        "Eyes could steal a sailor from the ",
        "Sea\" (doo do do do, doo do do do)",
        "V:",
        "Brandy wears a braided chain made of ",
        "Finest silver from the North of Spain, a ",
        "Locket that bears the name of a ",
        "Man that Brandy loved",
        "V:",
        "(He) came on a summer's day, bringing ",
        "Gifts from far away, but he ",
        "Made it clear he couldn't stay, no ",
        "Harbor was his home",
        "C:",
        "(The sailor said) \"Brandy, you're a fine girl (you're a fine girl) what a ",
        "Good wife you would be (such a fine girl) but my ",
        "Life, my love and my lady is the ",
        "Sea\" (doo do do do, doo do do do)",
        "BR1:",
        "(Yeah) Brandy used to watch his eyes when he ",
        "Told his sailor's story, she could ",
        "Feel the ocean fall and rise, she ",
        "Saw its raging glory",
        "BR2:",
        "(But) he had always told the truth, Lord, he ",
        "Was an honest man, and ",
        "Brandy does her best to understand",
        "(Doo do do do, doo do do do)",
        "V:",
        "At night when the bars close down",
        "Brandy walks through a silent town and",
        "Loves a man who's not around, she",
        "Still can hear him say",
        "C:",
        "(She hears him say) \"Brandy, you're a fine girl (you're a fine girl) what a ",
        "Good wife you would be (such a fine girl) but my ",
        "Life, my love and my lady is the ",
        "Sea\" (doo do do do, doo do do do)",
        "C:",
        "\"Brandy, you're a fine girl (you're a fine girl) what a ",
        "Good wife you would be (such a fine girl) but my ",
        "Life, my love and my lady is the ",
        "Sea\" (doo do do do, doo do do do)",
        "O:"
