  {
    "file": "Cactus Tree.songlyrics",
    "lastModifiedDate": 1719802524215,
    "song": {
      "title": "Cactus Tree",
      "artist": "Joni Mitchell",
      "user": "Shari C.",
      "dateCreated": 1719802524215,
      "lastModifiedDate": 1719802524215,
      "copyright": "1968 Reprise",
      "key": "F#",
      "defaultBpm": 91,
      "timeSignature": "4/4",
      "chords": [
        "I:",
        "F# B F# B",
        "V1:",
        "F# B F#B F#C#7",
        "F#B F#. B B",
        "PC:",
        "B. F# B. F#",
        "B. F# BC#7",
        "C1:",
        "F# C#7 F#sus4B F#B F#",
        "T:",
        "F# C#7 B B",
        "F#B F#B F#B B B F#"
      ],
      "lyrics": [
        "I:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V1:",
        "(There's a) man who's been out sailing in a decade full of dreams, and he ",
        "Takes her to a schooner and he treats her like a queen, bearing ",
        "Beads from California with their amber stones and green",
        "PC:",
        "(He has) called her from the harbor, he has ",
        "Kissed her with his freedom, he has ",
        "Heard her off to starboard, in the breaking and the breathing",
        "C1:",
        "(Of the) water weeds, and she was busy being free",
        "V1:",
        "(There's a) man who's climbed a mountain and he's calling out her name, and he ",
        "Hopes her heart can hear three thousand miles he calls again, he can ",
        "Think her there beside him, he can miss her just the ",
        "Same",
        "PC:",
        "(He has) missed her in the forest, while he ",
        "Showed her all the flowers, and the ",
        "Branches sang the chorus, as he ",
        "Climbed the scaley towers",
        "C1:",
        "(Of a) forest tree, while she was somewhere being free",
        "V1:",
        "(There's a) man who sent a letter and he's waiting for a reply, and he ",
        "Asks her of her travels since the day they said goodbye, he writes ",
        "\"I wish you were beside me, we can make it if we try\" ",
        "PC:",
        "(He has) seen her at the office with her ",
        "Name on all his papers, through the ",
        "Sharing of the profits, he will ",
        "Find it hard to shake her",
        "C1:",
        "(From his) memory, and she's so busy being free",
        "V1:",
        "(There's a) lady in the city and she thinks she loves them all, there's the ",
        "One who's thinking of her, there's the one who sometimes calls, there's the ",
        "One who writes her letters, with his facts and figures ",
        "Scrawl",
        "PC:",
        "(She has) brought them to her senses, they have ",
        "Laughed inside her laughter, now she",
        "Rallies her defenses, for she ",
        "Fears that one will ask her",
        "C1:",
        "(For) eternity, and she's so busy being free",
        "V1:",
        "(There's a) man who sends her medals and he's bleeding from the war, there's a",
        "Jouster and a jester and a man who owns a store, there's a ",
        "Drummer and a dreamer, and you know there may be ",
        "More",
        "PC:",
        "(She will) love them when she sees them, they will ",
        "Lose her if they follow, and she ",
        "Only means to please them, and her ",
        "Heart is full and hollow",
        "C1:",
        "(Like a) cactus tree, while she's so busy being free",
        "T:",
        "(Like a) cactus tree...being free"
      ]
    }
  },
