        "You can't escape this chess board you were born upon",
        "C:",
        "Who’s gonna win in the battle of the Chosen Ones?",
        "Who’s gonna bask in the glow of the final setting sun?",
        "Who does god love the most, his daughters or his sons?",
        "And who’s gonna win in the battle of the Chosen ",
        "I:",
        "(Ones?)",
        "V:",
        "These stories we’ve been told, they're lies that we’ve been sold",
        "Paying a heavy price, in human sacrifice",
        "This afterlife you crave, makes you a willing slave",
        "But you won’t know the difference lying in your grave",
        "C:",
        "Who’s gonna win in the battle of the Chosen Ones?",
        "Who’s gonna be there when humankind is done?",
        "Who does god love the most, the old ones or the young?",
        "And who’s gonna win in the battle of the Chosen ",
        "I:",
        "(Ones?)",
        "B:",
        "One day the truth will be revealed behind these lies",
        "The blinders we have worn will fall down from our eyes",
        "No one gets out alive, yes everybody dies",
