        "V:",
        "We’ve been hiding away, locked at home every day",
        "We’ve been distanced",
        "Isolated alone, in our quarantine zone",
        "For so long",
        "",
        "Gave us time to reflect, and you’d hope and expect",
        "We’d be stronger",
        "That we’d do all we can to stick to the plan",
        "And move on",
        "PC:",
        "We’re striving to get to a time when we all can be closer",
        "Staying six feet apart ain’t no good for your head or your heart",
        "But the ideological distances only grow longer",
        "And the hate and division is tearing us slowly apart",
        "BR:",
        "(lead riff)",
        "V:",
        "Tell me how I protect those I love and respect",
        "From the danger",
        "It’s been taking a toll on my heart and my soul it’s so-oo tough",
