        "(Instrumental)",
        "V2:",
        "I stopped by the bar at 3 A.M, to seek",
        "Solace in a bottle or possibly a friend, and I",
        "Woke up with a headache like my head against a board",
        "Twice as cloudy as I’d been the night before and I went in seeking",
