        "V:",
        "From the bottom of the well I feel pools of cool water ",
        "Moss-covered stones and cracks in the mortar ",
        "Found a little coin from a wish that I’d forgotten ",
        "I dried it on my shirttail put it back in my pocket ",
        "V:",
