        "To come and fill this well ",
        "Cool water",
        "PC1:",
        "My secret's to tell ",
        "My secret's to tell ",
        "V:",
        "I scaled upon the wall, but my grip was unsteady ",
        "If I were to fall, there was no water there to catch me ",
        "I reached for the frayed rope, it fell broken in my hand ",
        "I guess I’m doomed to sit here with my feet buried in the sand ",
        "C:",
        "And hope for, cool water ",
        "To come and fill this well ",
        "Cool water",
        "PC2:",
        "My secret's to tell ",
        "My secret's to tell ",
        "BR:",
        "Keeping my eyes fixed on these cloudy skies ",
        "Quenching my sun-cracked lips just like tears from your eyes ",
