      "lyrics": [
        "I:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V1:",
        "(Well I'm) on the downeaster Alexa, and I'm",
        "Cruisin' through Block Island Sound, I have ",
        "Charted a course to the vineyard, but",
        "Tonight I am Nantucket bound",
        "C:",
        "We took on diesel back in Montauk yesterday",
        "Left this morning from the bell in Gardiner's Bay",
        "Like all the locals here I've had to sell my home",
        "Too proud to leave, I work my fingers to the bone",
        "V2:",
        "(So I could) own my downeaster Alexa, and I ",
        "Go where the ocean is deep, there are ",
        "Giants out there in the canyons, and a ",
        "Good captain can't fall asleep",
        "C2:",
        "I got bills to pay and children who need clothes",
        "I know there's fish out there but where, God only knows",
        "They say these waters aren't what they used to be",
        "But I got people back on land who count on me, so if you ",
        "B:",
        "See my downeaster Alexa, and if you ",
        "Work with the rod and the reel, tell my ",
