      "lyrics": [
        "I:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V1:",
        "We both lie silently still in the dead of the night, although we ",
        "Both lie close together, we feel miles apart inside",
        "V2:",
        "(Was it) something I said or something I did? Did my ",
        "Words not come out right? Though I ",
        "Tried not to hurt you, though I ",
        "Tried, but I guess that's why they say",
        "C:",
        "Every rose has its thorn, just like ",
        "Every night has its dawn, just like ",
        "Every cowboy sings a sad, sad song",
        "Every rose has its thorn, yeah it does",
        "I:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V1:",
        "I listen to our favorite song playing on the radio, hear the",
        "DJ say, \"love's a game of easy come and easy go\"",
        "V2:",
        "(But I) wonder, does he know? Has he",
        "Ever felt like this? And I ",
        "Know that you'd be here right now if I ",
        "Could have let you know somehow",
        "C:",
        "(I guess) every rose has its thorn, just like ",
        "Every night has its dawn, just like ",
        "Every cowboy sings a sad, sad song",
        "Every rose has its thorn",
        "BR:",
        "Though it's been a while now, I can",
        "Still feel so much pain",
        "Like a knife that cuts you the wound heals",
        "But the scar, that scar remains",
        "I2:",
        "(instrumental solo)",
        "I:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V1:",
        "I know I could have saved a love that night, if I'd known what to say",
        "Instead of making love, we both made our separate ways",
