        "and let you in on what I've been thinking",
        "I started in, but got stuck again",
        "knowin' that it'd turn out wrong",
        "I pushed on through, forcing the issue",
        "hoping you would forgive my mistakes",
        "with every song that ever turned out wrong",
        "coming back to haunt the page",
        "so this spot is reserved, for if I ever find the words",
        "if there ever comes that day, when I know what I want to say",
        "but its a mystery, especially to me",
        "I got partway, still with nothing to say",
        "with every thought, locked up tight in my head",
        "with every doubt, that I can't work out",
        "stopping me from going on",
        "chorus",
        "So I gave up, knowing I'd failed you again",
        "with every thought locked up tight in my head",
        "for all my sins, I'm alone again",
        "frustration binding words inside",
        "chorus",
        "this spot's still reserved, for if I ever find the words",
        "if there ever comes that day when I know what I want to say",
        "but its a mystery, especially to me",
        "but its a mystery, especially to me"
