      "lyrics": [
        "V:",
        "The first Noel the angel did say, was to",
        "Certain poor shepherds in fields as they lay, in",
        "Fields where they lay keeping their sheep, on a",
        "Cold winter's night that was so deep",
        "C:",
        "Noel, Noel, Noel, Noel",
        "Born is the King of Israel",
        "V:",
        "They looked up and saw a star, shining",
        "In the east beyond them far, and",
        "To the earth it gave great light, and",
        "So it continued both day and night",
        "C:",
        "Noel, Noel, Noel, Noel",
        "Born is the King of Israel",
        "V:",
        "This star drew nigh to the northwest, over",
        "Bethlehem it took its rest, and",
        "There it did both stop and stay, right",
        "Over the place where Jesus lay",
        "C:",
        "Noel, Noel, Noel, Noel",
        "Born is the King of Israel",
        "V:",
        "This by the light of that same star, three",
