        "Knowin' what the cards were by the way they held their eyes so if",
        "You don't mind me sayin' I can see you're out of aces, for a",
        "Taste of your whiskey, I'll give you some advice\" so I",
        "V:",
        "Handed him my bottle and he drank down my last swallow",
        "- Then he bummed a cigarette and asked me for a light, and the",
        "Night got deathly quiet and his faced lost all expression he said \"If you're ",
        "Gonna play the game boy you gotta learn to play it right\" You've got to",
        "C:",
        "Know when to hold 'em, know when to fold 'em",
        "Know when to walk away, know when to run, you never",
        "Count your money, when you're sitting at the table, there'll be ",
        "Time enough for counting when the dealing's done",
        "I2:",
        "V3:",
