        "Of past battles won and lost and legends of old, a seasoned veteran in his own time, on the ",
        "Battlefield he gained respectful fame, with many medals of bravery and stripes to his name",
        "He grew a beard as soon as he could to cover the scars on his face, and always urged his men on ",
        "A2:",
        "(But on the) eve of a great battle with the infantry in dream the old General tossed in his sleep and wrestled with its meaning, he",
        "Awoke from the night to tell what he had seen and walked slowly out of his tent",
        "(All the) men held tall with their chests in the air, with courage in",
        "their blood and a fire in their stare and it was a ",
        "Grey morning and they all wondered how they would fare till the old General told them to go home",
        "C:",
        "(He said) \"I have seen the others and I have discovered that this fight is not worth fighting",
        "And I've seen their mothers and I will no other to follow me where I'm going, so",
