        "when he walks to the sea, He looks straight ahead not at me, ",
        "V:",
        "Tall and tan and young and handsome, the boy from Ipanema goes walking, and when he passes I smile, but he doesn't see.",
        "O:",
        "He just doesn't see. No, he doesn't see."
