        "V:",
        "It came upon the midnight clear, that",
        "Glorious song of old",
        "From angels bending near the earth to",
        "Touch their harps of gold",
        "C:",
        "Peace on the earth, goodwill to men, from",
        "Heaven's all gracious king",
        "The world in solemn stillness lay to",
        "Hear the angels sing",
        "V:",
        "Still through the cloven skies they come, with",
        "Peaceful wings unfurl, and",
        "Still their heavenly music floats, o'er",
        "All the weary world",
