        "It's ok (it's ok) OK OK OK",
        "It's ok (it's ok) We love you anyways",
        "V:",
        "for in those reckless moments in life, when doubt is creeping in your head",
        "feelin' like you lost your youth and the dreams you had are cold and dead",
        "I can't protect you like before. It's gonna take a different girl",
        "I can't reach you like before. You're slipping beyond my world",
        "C:",
        "but it's ok (it's ok!) you know we all seen better days",
        "it's ok (it's ok) you don't have to run and hide away",
        "it's ok (it's ok) it's ok ok ok",
        "it's ok (it's ok) we still love you anyway",
        "V:",
        "I wish that I could light the path that leads to a life of no mistakes",
        "hold you from the damned-be-done that living out of safety seems to take",
        "I still remember the child you were, as if only yesterday",
        "when it was easy to break through. I only had to kiss the pain away",
        "C:",
        "It's ok (it's ok) we love you anyway",
        "It's ok (it's ok) we all seen better days",
