        "Kayleigh, is it too late to say I'm sorry and Kayleigh could we get it together again?",
        "I just can't go on pretending, that it came to a natural end",
        "Kayleigh, oh I never thought I'd miss you, and Kayleigh I'd thought that we'd always be friends",
        "We said our love would last forever, so how did it come to this bitter end",
        "I2:",
        "(instrumental solo)",
        "I3:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V2:",
        "Do you remember, barefoot on the lawn with shooting stars?",
        "Do you remember, loving on the floor in Belsize Park?",
