        "V1:",
        "Lather was thirty years old today, they took away all of his toys",
        "His mother sent newspaper clippings to him, about his old friends who'd stopped being boys",
        "There was Harwitz E. Green, just turned thirty three, his leather chair waits at the bank",
        "And Sergeant Dow Jones, twenty seven years old, commanding his very own tank",
        "PC1:",
        "But Lather still finds it a nice thing to do, to lie about nude in the sand, drawing",
        "Pictures of mountains that look like bumps, and thrashing the air with his hands",
        "C:",
        "But wait, oh Lather's productive you know, he produces the finest of sound, putting",
        "Drumsticks on either side of his nose, snorting the best licks in town",
