        "",
        "...but that's all over",
        "I3:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V2:",
        "Lather was thirty years old today, and Lather came foam from his tongue",
        "He looked at me eyes wide and plainly said, is it true that I'm no longer young? (mommy?)",
        "And the children call him famous, what the old men call insane",
        "And sometimes he's so nameless, that he hardly knows which game to play, which words to say",
        "PC2:",
        "And I should have told him, \"no you're not old\" and I should have let him go on",
        "Smiling, baby wide",
