        "(instrumental)",
        "V:",
        "Dear God I’m writing this letter to you, 'cause I",
        "Don’t have a clue, can you help me?",
        "I’m sitting here, simply trying to figure out, what my",
        "Life’s all about, can you tell me?",
        "C:",
        "I never wanted to be, the person you ",
        "See, can you tell me who I am?",
        "I always wanted to die, but you kept me here ",
        "Alive, can you tell me who I am?",
        "V:",
        "I lie awake conducting this symphony that you have ",
        "Gifted to me but I can’t ever sleep",
        "Don’t be mad but I get weak inside and I start to ",
        "Fall apart 'cause I feel nothing",
        "C:",
        "I never wanted to be some kind of comic ",
        "Relief, please show me who I am",
        "I've been tortured and scorned since the day that I was ",
        "Born but I don't know who I am",
        "BR:",
        "And I thank you man for everything",
        "Sorry I'm so frightened about all of it but I wish I could give you more",
        "And all the lights are shining down on me, and I",
        "Feel intimidated by it all",
        "I2:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "C2:",
        "I never wanted to be, the person you ",
        "See, but thank you",
        "C:",
        "Oh God please tell me now, are you disappointed are you ",
        "Proud? Haven’t I done everything, everything?",
        "I’m so sorry I’m so weak and I’ve turned into a ",
        "Freak, but I don’t know anything, anything",
