        "Knives, on the way to the",
        "Fight, tonight they want revenge",
        "V:",
        "Beautiful soldiers in their",
        "Beds, making love inside their",
        "Hands, with no chance to",
        "Defend, tonight could be their end",
        "I2:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V:",
        "With the weapons in their",
        "Hands, and their eyes closed as they",
        "Stand, can they end it all",
        "Tonight so easily?",
        "V:",
        "Did the darkness of their",
        "Days, make them let go of their",
        "Light? Will they want to find a",
        "Way to make it all right?",
        "V2:",
        "When the beautiful",
        "Awake, see the sadness in their",
        "Eyes, will they want to find a",
        "Way to make it all",
        "Right, to make it all right?",
