        "La-la-la-la Lola",
        "Girls will be boys and boys will be girls",
        "It's a mixed up muddled up shook up world except for Lola",
        "La-la-la-la Lola",
        "I2:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "C:",
        "Well I left home just a week before",
