        "Br:",
        "G7 G7 C C",
        "A7 A7 D7 D7"
      ],
      "lyrics": [
        "V:",
        "Grab your coat and get you hat.  Leave your worry on the door – step.",
        "Just dir-ect your feet  To the sunny side of the street.  Can’t you",
        "V1:",
        "Hear a pit-ter-pat?  And that happy tune is your step.\t",
        "Life can be so sweet, On the sunny side of the street.  I used to",
        "BR:",
        "Walk in the shade, with my blues on parade.  Now, I’m not afraid; ",
        "- This Rover crossed over.   If I",
        "V:",
        " Never have a cent, I’ll be rich as Rock-e-fel-ler,",
        "Gold dust at my feet, On the sunny side of the street.   Yes, if I",
        "V1:",
        "Did n’t have a cent, I’d still be rich as Warren Buf-fet,",
        "Blue Chips at my feet, On the sunny side of the street.   "
      ]
    }
