        "D C G G"
      ],
      "lyrics": [
        "V:",
        "[Kid Rock:] Living my life in a slow hell.",
        "Different girl every night at the hotel.",
        "I ain't seen the sun shine in 3 damn days.",
        "V:",
        "Been fueling up on cocaine and whiskey.",
        "Wish I had a good girl to miss me.",
        "Lord I wonder if I'll ever change my ways.",
        "C:",
        "I put your picture away.",
        "Sat down and cried today.",
        "I can't look at you while I'm lying next to her.",
        "C:",
        "I put your picture away.",
        "Sat down and cried today.",
        "I can't look at you while I'm lying next to her. (Oooooooo)",
        "V:",
        "[Sheryl Crow:] I called you last night in the hotel.",
        "Everyone knows but they won't tell,",
        "But their half-hearted smiles tell me something just ain't right.",
        "V:",
        "I've been waiting on you for a long time,",
        "Fueling up on heartaches and cheap wine,",
        "I ain't heard from you in 3 damn nights.",
        "C:",
        "I put your picture away",
        "I wonder where you've been",
        "I can't look at you while I'm lying next to him",
        "C:",
        "I put your picture away",
        "I wonder where you've been",
        "I can't look at you while I'm lying next to him (Ooooooooo)",
        "V:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V:",
        "[SC:] I saw you yesterday with an old friend.",
        "[KR:] It was the same old same how have you been.",
        "[Together:] Since you've been gone my world's been dark and gray.",
        "V:",
        "[KR:] You reminded me of brighter days.",
        "[SC:] I hoped you were coming home to stay.",
        "I was headed to church. [KR:] I was off to drink you away",
        "V:",
        "[Together:] I thought about you for a long time.",
        "Can't seem to get you off my mind.",
        "I can't understand why we're living life this way.",
        "C:",
        "I found your picture today.",
        "I swear I'll change my ways.",
        "I just called to say I want you to come back home.",
        "C:",
        "I found your picture today.",
        "I swear I'll change my ways.",
        "I just called to say I want you to come back home.",
        "T:",
        "I just called to say I love you.",
        "Come back home."
      ]
    }
