      ],
      "lyrics": [
        "I:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V:",
        "Now somewhere in the Black Mountain Hills of Dakota there lived a",
        "Young boy named Rocky Raccoon",
        "And one day his woman ran off with ",
        "Another guy, hit young Rocky in the eye",
        "V:",
        "Rocky didn't like that he said",
        "\"I'm gonna get that boy,\" so one ",
        "Day he walked into town booked himself a room in the ",
        "Local saloon",
        "V:",
        "Rocky Raccoon, checked into his room",
        "Only to find Gideon's Bible",
        "V:",
        "Rocky had come, equipped with a gun, to",
        "Shoot off the legs of his rival",
        "V:",
        "His rival it seems, had broken his dreams by",
        "Stealing the girl of his fancy",
        "V:",
        "Her name was Magill, and she called herself Lil, but",
        "Everyone knew her as Nancy",
        "V:",
        "Now she and her man, who called himself Dan, were",
        "In the next room at the hoedown",
        "V:",
        "Rocky burst in, and grinning a grin, he said",
        "\"Danny boy, this is a showdown\"",
        "V:",
        "But Daniel was hot, he drew first and shot, and",
        "Rocky collapsed in the corner, ahh",
        "V:",
        "Da da da da da da da da da",
        "Da da da da da da da da da",
        "Da da da da da da da da da",
        "Do do do do do do",
        "V:",
        "Do do do do do do do do do",
        "Do do do do do do do do do",
        "Do do do do do do do do do",
        "Do do do do do do",
        "V:",
        "Now the doctor came in, stinking of gin, and",
        "Proceeded to lie on the table",
        "V:",
        "(He said) \"Rocky, you met your match\" and Rocky said \"Doc, it's only a scratch, and I'll be",
        "Better, I'll be better, Doc, as soon as I am able\"",
        "V:",
        "Now Rocky Raccoon, he fell back in his room",
        "Only to find Gideon's Bible (ta ta ta ta)",
        "V:",
        "Gideon checked out (aah aah) and he left it no doubt, to",
        "Help with good Rocky's revival, ahh, yeah, yeah",
        "V:",
        "Do do do do do do do do do, do do do do do do do",
        "Do do do do do do do do do do do do do do do do",
        "O:",
        "Do do do do do do do, come on Rocky boy, do do do do do do do, come on Rocky boy",
        "Do do do do do do do do do, the story of Rocky there"
      ]
