      "lyrics": [
        "I:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V:",
        "(Some say) love, it is a river that drowns the tender reed, some say",
        "Love, it is a razor that leaves your soul to bleed, some say ",
        "Love, it is a hunger, an endless aching need, I say ",
        "Love, it is a flower and you its only seed",
        "V:",
        "(It's the) heart afraid of breaking that never learns to dance, it's the ",
        "Dream afraid of waking that never takes the chance, it's the ",
        "One who won't be taken, who cannot seem to give, and the ",
        "Soul afraid of dying, that never learns to live",
        "V:",
        "(When the) night has been too lonely and the road has been too long, and you ",
        "Think that love is only for the lucky and the strong, just ",
        "Remember in the winter, far beneath the bitter snows, lies the ",
        "Seed that with the sun's love in the spring becomes the rose"
      ]
    }
