      "lyrics": [
        "I:",
        "(Instrumental)",
        "V:",
        "Beneath this snowy mantle cold and clean",
        "The unborn grass lies waiting for its",
        "Coat to turn to green",
        "V:",
        "The snowbird sings the song he always sings",
        "And speaks to me of flowers that will",
        "Bloom again in spring",
        "V:",
        "When I was young my heart was young then too",
        "Anything that it would tell me that’s the ",
        "Thing that I would do",
        "V:",
        "But now I feel such emptiness within",
        "For the thing that I want most in life’s",
        "The thing that I can’t win",
        "C:",
        "Spread your tiny wings and fly away, and",
        "Take the snow back with you where it ",
        "Came from on that day",
        "The one I love forever is untrue",
        "And if I could you know that I would",
        "Fly away with you",
        "V:",
        "The breeze along the river seems to say",
        "That he’ll only break me heart again should",
        "I decide to stay",
