        "Nut, turning water into wine, open doors would soon be",
        "V:",
        "Shut, so I went from day to day, thought my life was in a",
        "Rut, 'til I thought of what I'd say, which connection I should",
        "C:",
        "Cut, I was feeling part of the scenery",
        "I walked right out of the machinery",
        "My heart going boom boom boom",
        "\"Hey\" he said, \"Grab your things I've come to take you home\"",
        "I3:",
        "Hey back home",
        "(instrumental) 3/4 FIRST AND THIRD MEASURES",
        "V:",
        "...When illusion spin her net, I'm never where I want to",
        "Be, and liberty she pirouette, when I think that I am",
        "V:",
        "Free, watched by empty silhouettes, who close their eyes but still can",
        "See, no one taught them etiquette, I will show another me",
        "C:",
        "Today I don't need a replacement",
        "I'll tell them what the smile on my face",
        "Meant, my heart going boom boom boom",
        "\"Hey\" I said \"You can keep my things, they've come to take me home\"",
        "O:",
        "(instrumental)"
      ]
    }
  },
