        "Knows love can endure...and you know it will",
        "I:",
        "(instrumental riff) When you",
        "V3:",
        "See the Southern Cross for the first time, you",
        "Understand now why you came this way, 'cause the",
        "Truth you might be running from is so small, but it's as ",
        "Big as the promise, the promise of a coming day, so I'm",
        "V2:",
        "Sailing for tomorrow my dreams are a-dying, and my ",
        "Love is an anchor tied to you - tied with a silver chain, I have my",
        "Ship and all her flags are a-flying, she is ",
        "All that I have left and music is her name, think about",
        "PC:",
        "Think about how many times I have fallen",
        "Spirits are using me larger voices calling",
        "What Heaven brought you and me cannot be forgotten, I have been a-",
