        "(instrumental)",
        "V1:",
        "...I've never sailed on a sea, I would not challenge a giant",
        "...I could not take on the church (time will crawl) 'til the 21st century lose",
        "V2:",
        "...I know a government man, he was as blind as the moon, and he",
        "...He saw the sun in the night, he took a top-gun pilot and he",
        "V3:",
        "...He made him fly through a hole 'til he grew real old, and he",
        "...And he never came down, he just flew till he burst",
        "C1:",
        "(Time will crawl) 'til our mouths run dry (time will crawl) 'til our feet grow small",
        "(Time will crawl) 'til our tails fall off (time will crawl) 'til the 21st century lose",
        "I2:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V4:",
        "...I saw a black, black stream, full of white eyed fish",
        "...And a drowning man, with no eyes at all",
        "...I felt a warm, warm breeze, that melted metal and steel",
        "...I got a bad migraine,  that lasted three long years and",
        "...And the pills that I took,  made my fingers disappear",
        "I3:",
