        "Think about the woman, or the girl you knew the night before",
        "-",
        "V:",
        "(But your) thoughts will soon be wandering the way they always do, when you're",
        "Riding sixteen hours and there's nothing much to do, and you ",
        "Don't feel much like riding, you just wish the trip was through",
        "-",
        "C:",
        "(Say here I) am, on a road again, there I ",
        "Am, up on the stage, here I ",
        "Go, playing the star again, there I ",
        "Go, turn the page",
        "I2:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V:",
        "(Well you) walk into a restaurant, strung-out from the road, and you ",
        "Feel the eyes upon you as you're shaking off the cold, you",
        "Pretend it doesn't bother you but you just want to explode",
        "-",
        "V:",
        "Most times you can't hear 'em talk, other times you can, all the",
        "Same old clichés: \"Is that a woman or a man?\" And you",
        "Always seem outnumbered, you don't dare make a stand",
        "-",
        "C:",
        "(Say here I) am, on a road again, there I ",
        "Am, up on the stage, here I ",
        "Go, playing the star again, there I ",
        "Go, turn the page",
        "I2:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V:",
        "Out there in the spotlight you're a million miles away",
        "Every ounce of energy you try to give away, as the",
        "Sweat pours out your body like the music that you play",
        "-",
        "V:",
        "Later in the evening as you lie awake in bed, with the",
        "Echoes from the amplifiers ringin' in your head, you",
        "Smoke the day's last cigarette, remembering what she said",
        "-",
        "C:",
        "(Ah here I) am, on a road again, there I ",
        "Am, up on the stage, here I ",
        "Go, playing the star again, there I ",
        "Go, turn the page",
        "C2:",
        "(Ah here I) am, on a road again, there I ",
        "Am, up on the stage, here I ",
        "Go, playing the star again, there I ",
        "Go, there I go",
        "O:",
        "(instrumental sax)"
      ]
    }
  },
