      "lyrics": [
        "I:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V1:",
        "In the desert of my dreams I saw you there",
        "And I'm walking towards the water, steaming, body cold and bare, but your ",
        "Words cut loose the fire and you left my soul to bleed, and the ",
        "Pain that's in your truth deceiving me has got me scared",
        "C1:",
        "(Oh) why? (oh why?) oh why? (oh why?) ",
        "Ooh ooh ooh",
        "I:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V1:",
        "Through your eyes, the strains of battle like a brooding storm, you're up and ",
        "Down these pristine velvet walls like focus never forms",
        "My walls are getting wider and my eyes are drawn astray",
        "I see you now a vague deception of a dying day",
        "C2:",
        "(Oh) why? Oh why?",
        "Ooh ooh ooh ooh, ooh ooh ooh ooh, ah ah ah ah",
        "Ooh, ooh",
        "I:",
        "(instrumental)",
        "V2:",
