        "Crowds were standing, staring faceless cutting off my view to you, they ",
        "Start to limply flail their bodies in a twisted mime, and I'm ",
        "Lost inside this tangled web on which I'm lain entwined, you're gone and I'm",
        "Lost inside this tangled web on which I'm lain entwined",
