        "A new kind of jumped-up slippery fish",
        "C1:",
        "And all the monkeys aren't in the zoo",
        "Every day you meet quite a few",
        "So you see it's all up to you",
        "You can be better than you are",
        "You could be swingin' on a star",
        "O:",
        "(instrumental)"
      ]
