        "V1:",
        "I could be an oak tree, I could be the shore, I could be a campfire keeping you warm",
        "I could be the sunlight peeping through the cracks, but you'll never know 'cause you never looked back",
        "C1:",
        "At me you moved so fast, threw me down like a broken part, I'm",
        "So much more than that, but you'll never know 'cause you never looked",
        "Back",
        "V1:",
        "I could be a blanket, I could be a breeze, I could be the sugar in your morning tea",
        "I could be a penny at the bottom of a well, I could be a pearl in the middle of a shell",
        "V1:",
        "I could be a saviour, I could be a king, I could be the air underneath your wings",
        "I could be the light when the night goes black, but you'll never know, 'cause you never looked back",
        "C1:",
